{
  "name": "s3-assets-and-3d-pipeline",
  "private": true,
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "S3: sprite pipelines (atlas vs CSS sprite vs files; Canvas 2D vs PixiJS; 9-slice, parallax, tilemap; skeletal vs frame runtimes) and a glTF optimisation pipeline (gltf-transform: Draco vs meshopt, WebP/AVIF/KTX2, simplify, instancing) measured in headless Chromium with three.js.",
